Apertus 1.5 exposes image_token_id, not image_token_index, so the draft-model
proposer raised AttributeError while loading the drafter and the engine never
came up. Treat it like the other architectures that use image_token_id.

    AttributeError: 'Apertus1p5Config' object has no attribute
    'image_token_index'. Did you mean: 'image_token_id'?
      vllm/v1/spec_decode/llm_base_proposer.py:1386

